    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 2.2 Release Schedule",
      "source_hash": 610377861598090324,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "Python 2.2 릴리스 일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388253Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 5182493151762216630,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the Python 2.2 development and release schedule.",
      "source_hash": 3610776063179829036,
      "context_hash": 4441648796028552222,
      "translation": "이 문서는 Python 2.2의 개발 및 릴리스 일정을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The schedule primarily concerns itself with PEP-sized items.",
      "source_hash": 8496237367836649166,
      "context_hash": 16983118927058906663,
      "translation": "이 일정은 주로 PEP 규모의 항목을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388260Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Small bug fixes and changes will occur up until the first beta release.",
      "source_hash": 16383440806660689870,
      "context_hash": 6297256455543130785,
      "translation": "첫 번째 베타 릴리스까지 작은 버그 수정과 변경이 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388260Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The schedule below represents the actual release dates of Python 2.2.",
      "source_hash": 1771876413516296960,
      "context_hash": 3739897234609064110,
      "translation": "아래 일정은 Python 2.2의 실제 릴리스 날짜를 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388261Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Note that any subsequent maintenance releases of Python 2.2 should be covered by separate PEPs.",
      "source_hash": 3034953695006686554,
      "context_hash": 16341821583377314546,
      "translation": "이후에 이루어지는 Python 2.2의 유지 보수 릴리스는 별도의 PEP에서 다루어야 한다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388261Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Release Schedule",
      "source_hash": 2982503935265313731,
      "context_hash": 17283275267139471777,
      "translation": "릴리스 일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388262Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Tentative future release dates.",
      "source_hash": 13678692236315320723,
      "context_hash": 6537606243668559187,
      "translation": "향후 릴리스 예정 날짜입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388262Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Note that we've slipped this compared to the schedule posted around the release of 2.2a1.",
      "source_hash": 817877290715258350,
      "context_hash": 6772191673389257881,
      "translation": "2.2a1 릴리스 무렵에 게시된 일정과 비교하면 이 일정이 지연되었다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388263Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
