    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Release Manager",
      "source_hash": 4392981387520253530,
      "context_hash": 17347862493099487943,
      "translation": "릴리스 관리자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388265Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Barry Warsaw was the Python 2.2 release manager.",
      "source_hash": 17655090571145977488,
      "context_hash": 17167745339743764240,
      "translation": "Barry Warsaw가 Python 2.2 릴리스 관리자였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388265Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Release Mechanics",
      "source_hash": 15087488600485157013,
      "context_hash": 8041500083444107538,
      "translation": "릴리스 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388265Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We experimented with a new mechanism for releases: a week before every alpha, beta or other release, we forked off a branch which became the release.",
      "source_hash": 6876332474306081482,
      "context_hash": 8546708158412005297,
      "translation": "릴리스를 위한 새로운 방식을 시험했습니다. 모든 알파, 베타 또는 기타 릴리스가 있기 일주일 전에 릴리스가 될 브랜치를 분기했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388265Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Changes to the branch are limited to the release manager and his designated 'bots.",
      "source_hash": 4773997475828423700,
      "context_hash": 8580562080126110434,
      "translation": "브랜치에 대한 변경은 릴리스 관리자와 그가 지정한 '봇으로 제한됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388266Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This experiment was deemed a success and should be observed for future releases.",
      "source_hash": 15142042960208017455,
      "context_hash": 7915194398076387792,
      "translation": "이 실험은 성공한 것으로 평가되었으며 향후 릴리스에서도 이를 준수해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388266Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "See :pep:`101` for the actual release mechanics.",
      "source_hash": 6288496323624544272,
      "context_hash": 4887968517877184690,
      "translation": "실제 릴리스 방식은 :pep:`101`\\ 을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "New features for Python 2.2",
      "source_hash": 3743439301875871504,
      "context_hash": 9910150379590018463,
      "translation": "Python 2.2의 새로운 기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The following new features are introduced in Python 2.2.",
      "source_hash": 9162345835744044017,
      "context_hash": 308320754353200544,
      "translation": "다음과 같은 새로운 기능이 Python 2.2에 도입됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For a more detailed account, see Misc/NEWS [2]_ in the Python distribution, or Andrew Kuchling's \"What's New in Python 2.2\" document [3]_.",
      "source_hash": 3537451069501623015,
      "context_hash": 2903822596045851239,
      "translation": "더 자세한 내용은 Python 배포 패키지의 Misc/NEWS [2]_ 또는 Andrew Kuchling의 \"What's New in Python 2.2\" 문서 [3]_\\ 를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388267Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "iterators (:pep:`234`)",
      "source_hash": 14251165329082281335,
      "context_hash": 3246631905924404645,
      "translation": "이터레이터 (:pep:`234`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "generators (:pep:`255`)",
      "source_hash": 14964496855690301583,
      "context_hash": 2715191636052615120,
      "translation": "제너레이터 (:pep:`255`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "unifying long ints and plain ints (:pep:`237`)",
      "source_hash": 7868733089531633433,
      "context_hash": 5245532112453228799,
      "translation": "롱 정수와 일반 정수의 통합 (:pep:`237`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "division (:pep:`238`)",
      "source_hash": 13066797153604981575,
      "context_hash": 18064703886328035663,
      "translation": "나눗셈 (:pep:`238`)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:59:24.388268Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
